     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This update improves compatibility with the recent <b><a href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462833000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3xC2QNk42YGl-v5AW1pe70\">ggplot2</a></b> update and also introduces functionality for fitted model objects created using the <b><a href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/rstanarm/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/rstanarm/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462833000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wSkvmpLcCvk0OxKUVdkmA\">rstanarm</a></b> package. A few other minor notes are available on the <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/shinystan/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/shinystan/releases&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462833000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vQqzFaS1X4UQnahZJz9KE\">GitHub release page</a>.<div><br></div><div>To install from CRAN: </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">install</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">packages</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;shinystan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></code></div></font><div><br></div></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To install from GitHub:</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">if</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(!</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">require</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> install</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">packages</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>devtools</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">::</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">install_github</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;stan-dev/shinystan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> build_vignettes </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br></div></div>"
